{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not lose the whole record for custom-SerDes payloads**\n\n`deepCopy()` converts included output through the plugin's own Jackson mapper. A type supported by the configured SDK `SerDes` but not that mapper makes this throw, and the catch skips the exporter entirely, losing the terminal record. Normalize from the configured serialized payload, or catch conversion per field and omit only unsupported content; add a custom-SerDes integration test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv5A9","finding_digest":"01c1b4f157dfa084e51d95d8d2bb26f5f64497be955a6cbb7376f8c701851dbe","finding_id":"arf_v1_aha3j4kx36qijzi5sxmnfozg6x","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::custom-serdes-payload-record-preservation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::custom-serdes-payload-record-preservation","line":221,"observation_digest":"5d99cc1ab32c00e9847dd849bf4862c1e8e906f800289dcdb746568276b4c1d1","observation_id":"aro_v1_lwm4ygvtfqaotbd53be36sdcyh","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":221,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_a3q2dgwn2uscqvfgaynqv5vp7t","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
